%% State 02e — ReviewDispute case lifecycle
%% Evidence status: Implemented dispute lifecycle; external AI advisory branch is Partial.
%% Evidence: review_constants.ts and dispute commands under reviews/actions/commands.
%% Boundary: User-realm participants exchange evidence; only a System Admin principal operates the System board and resolves.

stateDiagram-v2
direction LR
    [*] --> pending : Confirmation action = disputed

    pending --> collecting_evidence : First participant response
    collecting_evidence --> collecting_evidence : Further evidence/response

    pending --> admin_reviewing : report to System realm
    collecting_evidence --> admin_reviewing : report to System realm
    pending --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts AI<br/>[complete case file]
    collecting_evidence --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts AI<br/>[complete case file]
    admin_reviewing --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts AI<br/>[complete case file]
    ai_reviewing --> ai_reviewing : System Admin starts another AI evaluation<br/>[complete case file]
    ai_reviewing --> admin_reviewing : Signed callback stores result

    pending --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    collecting_evidence --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    admin_reviewing --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    ai_reviewing --> resolved : System Admin resolves
    resolved --> [*]

    note right of ai_reviewing
        AI result is advisory only.
        ResolveReviewDisputeCommand owns final decision.
        Start policy accepts every active dispute state,
        including ai_reviewing; repeated evaluation is allowed.
    end note

    note left of resolved
        Enum also declares rejected and cancelled.
        No production command writes those two
        terminal values.
    end note
